Feed ranking pseudocode 

ALGORITHM FeedRanking

INPUT:
    List of posts
    User preferences

OUTPUT:
    Ranked list of posts

BEGIN
    rankedPosts = empty list

    FOR each post in posts DO

        IF post is not eligible THEN
            CONTINUE
        END IF

        likeScore = predictLike(post, user)
        commentScore = predictComment(post, user)
        shareScore = predictShare(post, user)
        watchScore = predictWatch(post, user)
        authorScore = calculateAuthorAffinity(post, user)
        recencyScore = calculateRecency(post)

        score = 4 * likeScore
              + 6 * commentScore
              + 5 * shareScore
              + 3 * watchScore
              + 2 * authorScore
              + recencyScore

        Add (post, score) to rankedPosts

    END FOR

    SORT rankedPosts by score in descending order

    APPLY diversity rules to rankedPosts

    DISPLAY rankedPosts

END
